{"name_en": "Parthenius (Antiochene)", "zh": "帕特尼", "sei": "帕特", "mei": "尼", "zh_full": "帕特尼烏斯", "sex": "m", "years": [359, 359], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "羅馬帝國", "role": "其他", "place": "安條克", "lat": 36.2, "lon": 36.16, "offices": [], "kin": [], "friends": ["Libanius", "Florentius (magister officiorum)", "Spectatus"], "foes": ["Eumolpius"], "bio": "安條克人，故友優西比烏斯之姪，為友赴湯蹈火，敢於直諫，輕財好施。359年赴宮廷，利巴尼烏斯致書弗洛倫提烏斯、斯佩克塔圖斯等薦之；又與歐莫爾皮烏斯因猜疑失和，利巴尼烏斯致書調解。", "stats": [25, 20, 50, 50, 55], "lean": "無", "conf": "C", "src": "Libanius Ep. 72"}
{"name_en": "Optatus (student of Libanius)", "zh": "奧普塔", "sei": "奧普", "mei": "塔", "zh_full": "奧普塔圖斯", "sex": "m", "years": [359, 359], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "羅馬帝國", "role": "其他", "place": "安條克", "lat": 36.2, "lon": 36.16, "offices": [], "kin": [], "friends": ["Libanius", "Vindonius Anatolius"], "foes": [], "bio": "利巴尼烏斯門生，阿納托利烏斯資助其百金習修辭。見同學尤利安努斯棄學從軍，附權貴而得勢，亦生羨慕之心。", "stats": [30, 30, 40, 35, 35], "lean": "無", "conf": "C", "src": "Libanius Ep. 80"}
{"name_en": "Ambrosius (governor 359)", "zh": "安布羅", "sei": "安布", "mei": "羅", "zh_full": "安布羅修斯", "sex": "m", "years": [359, 359], "birth": null, "death": null, "death_violent": false, "polity": "羅馬帝國", "role": "文臣", "place": "安條克", "lat": 36.2, "lon": 36.16, "offices": ["總督"], "kin": [], "friends": ["Libanius"], "foes": [], "bio": "年少即任官長。克萊奧布盧斯之親屬安提菲盧斯為其屬吏，廉而不貪，利巴尼烏斯受克萊奧布盧斯之託，致書請其善待之。", "stats": [35, 30, 45, 50, 45], "lean": "無", "conf": "C", "src": "Libanius Ep. 82"}
